The star icon in sun clock mode doesn't always contrast with the planet texture below it. Let's add a 1px black border around every star icon and planet/moon icon, and a shadow under every non-star icon (planet, moon, satellite, etc).

The star's rendered color has too much effect on the illumination shown in sun clock mode. Let's turn down the saturation to about one quarter the original value.

